From 8ecbb50004482893f45a74d781d7a617b6368738 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jayneelatintel <jayneel.vora@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 05:24:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] ci: drop the GitHub Actions workflows inherited from
 llama.cpp

The fork carries upstream's CI definitions (49 files, including
release.yml and docker.yml). This tree is built locally with build.cmd,
so they do not apply to it, and any push of the patched tree to a
repository with Actions enabled would start them.
